; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR SORT  -  watch $FC PULSESORTXY sort twenty numbers   (VM1 @ $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Press any key to start. Twenty random numbers (1-60) appear as bars; each
; pass is ONE $FC PULSESORTXY opcode - a bubble-sort pass - and only the bars
; that moved are redrawn. When a pass finds nothing to swap it stops and shows
; how many passes it took. Then:  A sort up   D sort down   N new numbers   ESC (or Q) quit
;
; $FC PULSESORTXY ZD XY: one bubble pass over RX..RY (RY = the LAST element),
; Z = 0 up / 1 down, D = cell size in bytes. ExitCode $01 = something swapped,
; $00 = already in order, so a full sort is "pass, TESTEXIT 00, repeat".
; Measured on V0061.33: 160 random arrays (1- and 2-byte cells, both directions)
; identical to a Python bubble pass; full sorts take bubble sort's pass count.
; The first app to use $FC.
;
; VT100 only (reverse video, cursor addressing, erase-to-end-of-line). RAND is
; spun while it waits for the first key, so each run sorts different numbers.
; The pause between passes is the DLYI operand at $40A2 (now $06).
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 (Craig).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/sortvis_verify.py, V0061.33 image): the output is
; replayed into a VT100 screen and, after EVERY pass, the twenty bars must show
; exactly a Python bubble sort's state after that pass - PASS 2026-11-22 with the sorted chime (run on V0061.34).
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 225 STELLAR commands, $4000-$4241 (578 bytes).  Arrays at $4900/$4940, the bar's
; run of spaces at $4A00, strings at $4B00.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START                              Start of program, and run the label pre-pass
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A                    Ten, for printing numbers
; D 4005 11 02 00 14    LOADXI R2 0014                     How many numbers
; D 4009 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, clear the screen, hide the cursor
; D 400B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 400D CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 400F CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 4011 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4013 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4015 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4017 CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 4019 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 401B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 401D CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 401F CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4021 CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4023 CA 6C          SEROUTI 6C 'l'
; D 4025 11 0D 00 01    LOADXI R13 0001
; D 4029 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 402D BD 02 20       CALL POSXY
; D 4030 11 0E 0B 00    LOADXI R14 0B00
; D 4034 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The title on line 1
; D 4036 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 403A 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 403E BD 02 20       CALL POSXY
; D 4041 11 0E 0B 41    LOADXI R14 0B41
; D 4045 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 4047 C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes - every run differs
; D 4048 CC             SERST
; D 4049 A1 00 47       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 404C CB             SERIN                              and throw the key away -
; D 404D 81 00 1B       TESTAI 001B
; D 4050 A1 00 61       IFFALSEI NEW                       unless it is a lone ESC
; D 4053 BD 01 95       CALL KWAIT
; D 4056 A1 01 72       IFFALSEI QUIT
; D 4059 CB             SERIN                              an arrow (ESC [ x): its two bytes are thrown away
; D 405A BD 01 95       CALL KWAIT
; D 405D A1 00 61       IFFALSEI NEW
; D 4060 CB             SERIN
; NEW:
; D 4061 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; D 4065 11 07 00 3C    LOADXI R7 003C
; FILL:
; D 4069 C3             RAND
; D 406A 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 406C 4D 67          DIVXY R6 / R7                      RAND mod 60
; D 406E 27             COPYREMA
; D 406F 4E 00 01       ADDAI 0001                         + 1
; D 4072 2F 03 09 00    WRITEIDX R3 0900
; D 4076 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4078 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 407A A1 00 69       IFFALSEI FILL
; D 407D 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000                     Ascending
; SORT:
; D 4081 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000                     No passes yet
; D 4085 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; ALL:
; D 4089 BD 01 AA       CALL DRAWROW
; D 408C 42 03          INCX R3
; D 408E 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 4090 A1 00 89       IFFALSEI ALL
; D 4093 BD 01 F8       CALL STATUS
; PASS:
; D 4096 11 0D 09 00    LOADXI R13 0900
; D 409A 11 0E 09 40    LOADXI R14 0940
; D 409E 3B DE 14       COPYMXMY R13 R14 14                Keep the numbers as they were
; D 40A1 C0 06          DLYI 06                            The watching speed
; D 40A3 11 06 09 00    LOADXI R6 0900
; D 40A7 11 07 09 13    LOADXI R7 0913                     RX = first, RY = LAST element
; D 40AB 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 40AD A1 00 B6       IFFALSEI DOWN
; D 40B0 FC 01 67       PULSESORTXY up, bytes, R6..R7      ONE bubble pass, ascending
; D 40B3 B0 00 B9       GAL PASSED
; DOWN:
; D 40B6 FC 11 67       PULSESORTXY down, bytes, R6..R7    ONE bubble pass, descending
; PASSED:
; D 40B9 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 40BD 96 00          TESTEXIT 00                        ExitCode $00: nothing was swapped
; D 40BF A1 00 C6       IFFALSEI SWAPPED
; D 40C2 11 08 00 01    LOADXI R8 0001                     Remember it - drawing must not be what decides
; SWAPPED:
; D 40C6 42 01          INCX R1
; D 40C8 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000                     Redraw only the lines that changed
; CHG:
; D 40CC 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 40D0 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 40D2 2E 03 09 40    READIDX R3 0940
; D 40D6 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 40D8 87 67          TESTXY R6 = R7
; D 40DA A0 00 E0       IFTRUEI SAME
; D 40DD BD 01 AA       CALL DRAWROW
; SAME:
; D 40E0 42 03          INCX R3
; D 40E2 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 40E4 A1 00 CC       IFFALSEI CHG
; D 40E7 BD 01 F8       CALL STATUS
; D 40EA 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 40EC A0 00 96       IFTRUEI PASS                       Something moved: another pass
; DONE:
; D 40EF 11 0E 0B 96    LOADXI R14 0B96
; D 40F3 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Sorted
; D 40F5 F1 4C 00       RUNMC 4C00                         a rising chime
; D 40F8 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 40FC 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 4100 BD 02 20       CALL POSXY
; D 4103 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Clear the old prompt
; D 4105 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4107 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 4109 11 0E 0B 59    LOADXI R14 0B59
; D 410D C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; KEY:
; D 410F CB             SERIN                              Wait for a key (other VMs keep running)
; D 4110 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 4112 86 06 00 1B    TESTXI R6 001B
; D 4116 A1 01 29       IFFALSEI KEYL
; D 4119 BD 01 95       CALL KWAIT                         ESC: an arrow following?
; D 411C A1 01 72       IFFALSEI QUIT                      no: ESC on its own quits
; KESC:
; D 411F CB             SERIN                              yes: the rest of it is thrown away
; D 4120 BD 01 95       CALL KWAIT
; D 4123 A0 01 1F       IFTRUEI KESC
; D 4126 B0 01 0F       GAL KEY
; KEYL:
; D 4129 86 06 00 71    TESTXI R6 0071
; D 412D A0 01 72       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 4130 86 06 00 51    TESTXI R6 0051
; D 4134 A0 01 72       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 4137 86 06 00 61    TESTXI R6 0061
; D 413B A0 01 64       IFTRUEI UP
; D 413E 86 06 00 41    TESTXI R6 0041
; D 4142 A0 01 64       IFTRUEI UP
; D 4145 86 06 00 64    TESTXI R6 0064
; D 4149 A0 01 6B       IFTRUEI DN
; D 414C 86 06 00 44    TESTXI R6 0044
; D 4150 A0 01 6B       IFTRUEI DN
; D 4153 86 06 00 6E    TESTXI R6 006E
; D 4157 A0 00 61       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 415A 86 06 00 4E    TESTXI R6 004E
; D 415E A0 00 61       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 4161 B0 01 0F       GAL KEY
; UP:
; D 4164 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000
; D 4168 B0 00 81       GAL SORT
; DN:
; D 416B 11 05 00 01    LOADXI R5 0001
; D 416F B0 00 81       GAL SORT
; QUIT:
; D 4172 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, cursor back, clear, home
; D 4174 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4176 CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 4178 CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 417A CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 417C CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 417E CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 4180 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4182 CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4184 CA 68          SEROUTI 68 'h'
; D 4186 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4188 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 418A CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 418C CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 418E CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4190 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4192 CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 4194 00             HALT
; KWAIT:
; D 4195 11 07 00 08    LOADXI R7 0008
; KWAIT1:
; D 4199 CC             SERST
; D 419A A0 01 A5       IFTRUEI KWAIT2
; D 419D 43 07          DECX R7
; D 419F 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 41A1 A1 01 99       IFFALSEI KWAIT1
; D 41A4 CC             SERST                              Test false: nothing came
; KWAIT2:
; D 41A5 BE 00          RETURN
; D 41A7 F0 00 00       BREAK                              End of program
; DRAWROW:
; D 41AA 23 00 3D       COPYXY R3 -> R13
; D 41AD 52 0D 00 03    ADDXI R13 0003                     screen line
; D 41B1 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 41B5 BD 02 20       CALL POSXY
; D 41B8 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 41BC 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4                   R4 = the value
; D 41BE 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 41C0 25             COPYMAA
; D 41C1 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C4 C9             SEROUT                             tens
; D 41C5 27             COPYREMA
; D 41C6 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C9 C9             SEROUT                             units
; D 41CA CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 41CC CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Reverse video: a space is a block
; D 41CE CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41D0 CA 37          SEROUTI 37 '7'
; D 41D2 CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 41D4 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 41D7 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   Cut the run of spaces to the value
; D 41DB 11 0E 0A 00    LOADXI R14 0A00
; D 41DF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       the bar
; D 41E1 10 00 20       LOADAI 0020
; D 41E4 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   and mend it
; D 41E8 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video; erase what the old bar left
; D 41EA CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41EC CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 41EE CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 41F0 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41F2 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41F4 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 41F6 BE 00          RETURN
; STATUS:
; D 41F8 11 0D 00 17    LOADXI R13 0017
; D 41FC 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 4200 BD 02 20       CALL POSXY
; D 4203 11 0E 0B 90    LOADXI R14 0B90
; D 4207 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4209 23 00 14       COPYXY R1 -> R4
; D 420C 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 420E 25             COPYMAA
; D 420F 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4212 C9             SEROUT
; D 4213 27             COPYREMA
; D 4214 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4217 C9             SEROUT
; D 4218 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 421A CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 421C CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 421E BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 4220 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4222 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4224 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 4226 25             COPYMAA
; D 4227 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 422A C9             SEROUT
; D 422B 27             COPYREMA
; D 422C 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 422F C9             SEROUT
; D 4230 CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 4232 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 4234 25             COPYMAA
; D 4235 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4238 C9             SEROUT
; D 4239 27             COPYREMA
; D 423A 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 423D C9             SEROUT
; D 423E CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 4240 BE 00          RETURN

